1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:04,129
[JORDAN]<i> I know this isn't</i>
<i>just about the company.</i>

2
00:00:04,212 --> 00:00:05,338
<i>Maybe…</i>

3
00:00:06,256 --> 00:00:07,924
<i>it's about what your dad wants.</i>

4
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:12,887
<i>It won't be long</i>

5
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:15,432
<i>before we finally get out of here.</i>

6
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:16,766
<i>You know what?</i>

7
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:22,731
<i>I can feel that your father</i>
<i>is genuinely sorry.</i>

8
00:00:24,023 --> 00:00:26,192
<i>Do you think</i>

9
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:28,903
<i>he still loves me?</i>

10
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:31,489
<i>Um…</i>

11
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,454
<i>That's possible, Ma.</i>

12
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:40,165
<i>I was thinking the same thing.</i>

13
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:41,332
<i>It's possible.</i>

14
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:44,461
<i>But there's a problem.</i>

15
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:48,131
<i>That Billy and her aunt.</i>

16
00:00:48,798 --> 00:00:50,175
<i>I hate sharing.</i>

17
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:52,886
<i>Your father is ours alone.</i>

18
00:00:52,969 --> 00:00:53,970
<i>Do you understand?</i>

19
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:58,224
<i>You can wear it all day!</i>

20
00:00:58,308 --> 00:00:59,809
<i>You've been requesting these, right?</i>

21
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:02,562
<i>- See? I listen to your--</i>
- [KNOCKING ON DOOR]

22
00:01:02,645 --> 00:01:09,652
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

23
00:01:11,654 --> 00:01:12,906
<i>Did you miss me?</i>

24
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:17,744
<i>I kept my promise. I returned to you.</i>

25
00:01:17,827 --> 00:01:18,953
[KAREN CHUCKLES]

26
00:01:19,037 --> 00:01:23,249
<i>♪ Do you know when I found you</i>
<i>Everything changed? ♪</i>

27
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:24,667
<i>You know that boy?</i>

28
00:01:24,751 --> 00:01:29,881
<i>♪ Stay right there, my love</i>
<i>Because I'm coming home ♪</i>

29
00:01:29,964 --> 00:01:31,049
<i>He's my son.</i>

30
00:01:31,132 --> 00:01:34,469
<i>Nice! Your son is a big shot.</i>

31
00:01:34,552 --> 00:01:38,181
<i>Wow! How cool!</i>

32
00:01:38,264 --> 00:01:41,559
[SONG CONTINUES ON PHONE]

33
00:01:41,643 --> 00:01:48,650
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

34
00:01:51,111 --> 00:01:52,612
- [WOMAN 1]<i> Come on!</i>
- [WOMAN 2] <i>Let us in!</i>

35
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:55,115
<i>- We'll open soon.</i>
<i>- Just wait, please.</i>

36
00:01:55,198 --> 00:01:57,534
<i>- That's a promise.</i>
- [WOMAN] <i>We want to get inside.</i>

37
00:01:57,617 --> 00:02:04,165
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

38
00:02:11,631 --> 00:02:18,638
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

39
00:02:19,264 --> 00:02:21,349
- [RAIN] <i>You can go inside now.</i>
- [ROBBIE] <i>Come in.</i>

40
00:02:21,432 --> 00:02:23,226
[RAIN]<i> One by one, please.</i>

41
00:02:26,146 --> 00:02:27,647
[RAIN] <i>Again, one by one, please.</i>

42
00:02:30,775 --> 00:02:32,026
[RAIN] <i>Watch your step.</i>

43
00:02:33,444 --> 00:02:36,823
- [MAN] <i>Finally, we're going in.</i>
- [WOMAN] <i>This is great!</i>

44
00:02:36,906 --> 00:02:43,705
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

45
00:03:03,433 --> 00:03:10,148
