46
00:04:07,914 --> 00:04:09,666
- [MAN] This is fun.
- [ROBBIE] The place is packed.

47
00:04:09,749 --> 00:04:11,417
- [RAIN] It is.
- I hope it's always like this.

48
00:04:11,501 --> 00:04:12,377
My gosh!

49
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:14,545
- The bar is full tonight!
- [ROBBIE] This is good for us.

50
00:04:14,629 --> 00:04:15,713
You know why?

51
00:04:15,797 --> 00:04:19,384
Because it's Jordan Valentin's
night tonight! [CHUCKLES]

52
00:04:20,176 --> 00:04:23,012
Hey, you're making the ice
in that bucket melt

53
00:04:23,096 --> 00:04:26,349
