54
00:04:26,432 --> 00:04:28,309
Just move on already.

55
00:04:28,393 --> 00:04:29,894
[ROBBIE SCOFFS]

56
00:04:29,978 --> 00:04:30,979
I already did.

57
00:04:31,062 --> 00:04:34,983
I've found a match on LoveList.

58
00:04:35,066 --> 00:04:37,777
Yeah, right. More like a rebound.

59
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:38,861
Of course not.

60
00:04:38,945 --> 00:04:41,322
- [WOMAN 1] I'm so excited!
- [WOMAN 2] It's starting!

61
00:04:41,406 --> 00:04:44,909
Are you guys ready to see Jordan live?

62
00:04:44,993 --> 00:04:46,703
- Whoo!
- Yes!

63
00:04:46,786 --> 00:04:50,331
[APPLAUSE, CHEERING]

64
00:04:50,415 --> 00:04:52,667
[VALERIE] Thank you, guys,
for coming tonight.

65
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,711
Thank you for your full support.

66
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:57,046
I know that you're all excited
to see Jordan,

67
00:04:57,130 --> 00:04:59,674
so I won't make you wait any longer.

68
00:04:59,757 --> 00:05:02,552
Without further ado,
let me introduce to you

69
00:05:02,635 --> 00:05:05,930
the most talented, the most handsome,

70
00:05:06,014 --> 00:05:08,850
Jordan Valentin!

71
00:05:08,933 --> 00:05:13,604
[APPLAUSE, CHEERING]

72
00:05:15,315 --> 00:05:16,941
Thank you for coming, everyone!

73
00:05:17,025 --> 00:05:18,943
I know this might be
everyone's favorite song,

74
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:21,195
so to tickle your eardrums…

75
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,572
- [JORDAN] Let's go.
- [WOMAN] Jordan!

76
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,366
- [WOMEN SQUEALING]
- ["PAUWI NA" PLAYING]

77
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:28,244
<i>♪ I got lost again ♪</i>

78
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:32,290
<i>♪ Like I learned nothing before ♪</i>

79
00:05:33,541 --> 00:05:36,252
<i>♪ How many thousands of roads ♪</i>

80
00:05:36,335 --> 00:05:40,631
<i>♪ Will I walk before giving up ♪</i>

81
00:05:40,715 --> 00:05:45,845
<i>♪ Just to find you</i>
<i>And for you to find me? ♪</i>

82
00:05:46,471 --> 00:05:52,351
<i>♪ I hope your heart can save me</i>
<i>If there are challenges ♪</i>

83
00:05:52,435 --> 00:05:56,647
<i>♪ Save this feeling and help me ♪</i>

84
00:05:56,731 --> 00:05:59,358
<i>♪ My muse ♪</i>

85
00:05:59,442 --> 00:06:04,447
<i>- ♪ Where's our destination? ♪</i>
- [CROWD CHEERING]

86
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:07,033
<i>♪ You are the captain ♪</i>

87
00:06:07,116 --> 00:06:11,370
<i>♪ I'll follow wherever you go ♪</i>

88
00:06:11,454 --> 00:06:12,622
<i>♪ Oh, baby ♪</i>

89
00:06:12,705 --> 00:06:16,709
<i>- ♪ I'll ride your wave ♪</i>
