90
00:06:16,793 --> 00:06:20,421
<i>♪ Wherever it takes me ♪</i>

91
00:06:20,505 --> 00:06:25,009
<i>♪ Do you know when I found you</i>
<i>Everything changed? ♪</i>

92
00:06:25,635 --> 00:06:28,429
<i>♪ Wherever I go ♪</i>

93
00:06:28,513 --> 00:06:32,183
<i>♪ My heart won't be lost ♪</i>

94
00:06:32,266 --> 00:06:35,978
<i>♪ Even if you let go</i>
<i>I'll come back ♪</i>

95
