124
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:23,294
<i>- ♪ Oh my God, I'm so in love ♪</i>
<i>- </i>[JORDAN]<i> ♪ So in love ♪</i>

125
00:08:23,377 --> 00:08:27,173
- <i>♪ From then until now ♪</i>
<i>- </i>[JORDAN]<i> ♪ Until now ♪</i>

126
00:08:27,256 --> 00:08:30,885
<i>- ♪ Oh my God, I'm so in love ♪</i>
<i>- </i>[JORDAN] <i>So in love</i>

127
00:08:30,968 --> 00:08:34,096
- <i>♪ From then until now ♪</i>
<i>- </i>[JORDAN]<i> ♪ From then until now ♪</i>

128
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,265
- What are you doing here?!
- [CALOY GASPS]

129
00:08:37,183 --> 00:08:39,060
- Don't do anything stupid.
- [CROWD CHEERING]

130
00:08:39,143 --> 00:08:40,937
Let's go outside. Come on!

131
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:43,523
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]
- [CROWD CHEERING]

132
00:08:43,606 --> 00:08:48,110
- [CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICKING]
- [TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

133
00:08:48,194 --> 00:08:50,988
- Come here!
- Hey!

134
00:08:51,072 --> 00:08:53,449
- Caloy!
- What were you doing there?

135
00:08:53,533 --> 00:08:55,243
And why are you meddling?

136
00:08:55,326 --> 00:08:57,078
I had a plan.

137
00:08:57,161 --> 00:08:58,454
A plan that was going to fail.

138
00:08:58,538 --> 00:09:01,123
Seriously? Hurting someone
in front of so many people?

139
00:09:01,207 --> 00:09:02,500
Are you insane?!

140
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,585
Who was your target there?

141
00:09:06,587 --> 00:09:07,672
Jordan.

142
00:09:07,755 --> 00:09:09,423
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

143
00:09:09,507 --> 00:09:10,633
Jordan Valentin?

144
00:09:12,552 --> 00:09:13,803
Is he your relative?

145
00:09:13,886 --> 00:09:20,893
[UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES]

146
00:09:28,651 --> 00:09:30,278
[VALERIE] Oh my gosh!

147
00:09:30,361 --> 00:09:33,573
Your live performance video
has reached 100,000 views.

148
00:09:33,656 --> 00:09:36,826
- [JORDAN] Really?
- And my wall is flooded with inquiries.

149
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,246
Everyone wants a piece of you, Jordan.

150
00:09:40,329 --> 00:09:42,373
- [CHUCKLES]
- [BOTTLES CLINKING]

151
00:09:42,456 --> 00:09:43,708
- Great.
- [VALERIE CHUCKLES]

152
00:09:45,835 --> 00:09:48,921
I'm glad that the crowd still loved it

153
00:09:49,005 --> 00:09:51,882
even though it wasn't
your best performance.

154
00:09:51,966 --> 00:09:54,093
You seemed distracted earlier.

155
00:09:54,969 --> 00:09:56,804
Is it because of Billy again?

156
00:09:56,887 --> 00:09:59,015
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

157
00:09:59,098 --> 00:10:00,683
Did you invite her?

158
00:10:01,851 --> 00:10:02,852
Yes, of course.

159
00:10:04,729 --> 00:10:06,856
Did you really expect her to come

160
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:09,692
after losing her cool
at the office earlier?

161
00:10:10,651 --> 00:10:11,986
She already said no.

162
00:10:14,530 --> 00:10:16,991
But I was still hoping
she'd change her mind.

163
00:10:17,617 --> 00:10:19,076
Yeah, right.

164
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:22,788
You know that best friend of yours
is a workaholic.

165
00:10:22,872 --> 00:10:25,541
Actually, she even has
instructions for us.

166
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:26,709
Here, look.

167
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:29,420
"Be prepared with concrete suggestions

168
00:10:29,503 --> 00:10:33,132
on how we can increase the subscriptions
and strengthen our numbers

169
00:10:33,215 --> 00:10:36,510
to attract more sponsors and advertisers."

170
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:39,764
"Come in with solutions,
and not observations."

171
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:41,015
Like…

172
00:10:41,098 --> 00:10:42,683
What does she expect?

173
00:10:42,767 --> 00:10:45,978
That we won't sleep
until LoveList improves?

174
00:10:46,646 --> 00:10:47,897
Harsh, right?

175
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:50,024
So annoying.

176
00:10:50,107 --> 00:10:52,943
Val, she's just doing her job.

177
00:10:53,027 --> 00:10:54,070
She's the CEO.

178
00:10:55,196 --> 00:10:57,531
It's her job to make sure
the company succeeds.

179
00:10:58,199 --> 00:11:01,077
Not to please everyone, not to be nice.

180
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,079
Sometimes, she has to put her foot down.

181
00:11:03,829 --> 00:11:05,247
Besides, it's for our benefit.

182
00:11:09,168 --> 00:11:10,211
Fine.

183
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,927
I didn't know he was your son.
That jerk did me wrong.

184
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:21,347
- He did you wrong?
- Yes. And the woman I love!

185
00:11:21,430 --> 00:11:24,100
They filed several charges against us
and sent me to jail.

186
00:11:24,183 --> 00:11:26,060
That's why I want to get back at him.

187
00:11:27,103 --> 00:11:29,230
Don't you dare hurt Jordan.

188
00:11:29,313 --> 00:11:31,857
If you lay a finger on him,
you'll answer to me.

189
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:34,610
You better show some gratitude.

190
00:11:34,693 --> 00:11:38,697
If it weren't for me,
you'd still be in jail.

191
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:40,282
Is that clear?

192
00:11:40,366 --> 00:11:45,204
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

193
00:11:45,287 --> 00:11:46,580
Yes.

194
00:11:47,164 --> 00:11:48,290
Yes, what?

195
00:11:49,041 --> 00:11:50,668
I won't kill your son.

196
00:11:50,751 --> 00:11:53,921
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

197
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,256
Give it back.

198
00:11:56,132 --> 00:11:57,091
[SCOFFS]

199
00:12:11,897 --> 00:12:13,732
[BEA] <i>We'll get out of here, Ma.</i>

200
00:12:15,317 --> 00:12:17,194
<i>We'll rise up from this.</i>

201
00:12:18,070 --> 00:12:20,114
<i>And if you still love Papa,</i>

202
00:12:20,990 --> 00:12:24,160
<i>I'll take him back for you.</i>

203
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:26,704
<i>Our family will be complete again.</i>

204
00:12:26,787 --> 00:12:33,502
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

205
00:12:47,266 --> 00:12:53,189
["TABLA TAYO" BY FANA PLAYING]

206
00:13:00,779 --> 00:13:01,864
[CELLPHONE CHIMES]

207
00:13:14,502 --> 00:13:21,509
LOVELIST NEVER RUNS OUT
OF CONTROVERSIES, RIGHT?

208
00:13:32,937 --> 00:13:39,443
TO THE CEO, DO US ALL A FAVOR
AND SHUT IT DOWN!

209
00:13:41,403 --> 00:13:45,866
<i>Let's remind them why</i>
<i>they trusted LoveList in the first place.</i>

210
00:13:46,825 --> 00:13:49,078
<i>We'll launch something bigger.</i>

211
00:13:49,161 --> 00:13:52,164
<i>Media coverage, real couples,</i>
<i>success stories.</i>

212
00:13:52,248 --> 00:13:53,958
<i>If trust is the issue here,</i>

213
00:13:54,041 --> 00:13:56,168
<i>then we'll rebuild that trust publicly.</i>

214
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:59,088
<i>That's a good strategy.</i>

215
00:13:59,171 --> 00:14:06,095
<i>But with our negative image right now,</i>
<i>sponsors might be hard to find.</i>

216
00:14:06,178 --> 00:14:12,935
["TABLA TAYO" CONTINUES]

217
00:14:24,655 --> 00:14:30,703
["TABLA TAYO" CONTINUES]

218
