<i>♪ Like I learned nothing before ♪</i>

222
00:14:56,270 --> 00:14:58,981
<i>♪ How many thousands of roads ♪</i>

223
00:14:59,064 --> 00:15:03,110
<i>♪ Will I walk before giving up ♪</i>

224
00:15:03,193 --> 00:15:08,699
<i>♪ Just to find you</i>
<i>And for you to find me? ♪</i>

225
00:15:08,782 --> 00:15:14,788
<i>♪ I hope your heart can save me</i>
<i>If there are challenges ♪</i>

226
00:15:14,872 --> 00:15:18,542
<i>♪ Save this feeling and help me ♪</i>

227
