<i>♪ You are the captain ♪</i>

230
00:15:30,012 --> 00:15:34,016
<i>♪ I'll follow wherever you go ♪</i>

231
00:15:34,099 --> 00:15:35,476
<i>♪ Oh, baby ♪</i>

232
00:15:35,559 --> 00:15:39,480
<i>- ♪ I'll ride your wave ♪</i>
- [CROWD CHEERING]

233
00:15:39,563 --> 00:15:43,233
<i>♪ Wherever it takes me ♪</i>

234
00:15:43,317 --> 00:15:48,322
<i>♪ Do you know when I found you</i>
<i>Everything changed? ♪</i>

235
00:15:48,405 --> 00:15:50,950
<i>♪ Wherever I go ♪</i>

236
00:15:51,033 --> 00:15:54,995
<i>♪ My heart won't be lost ♪</i>

237
00:15:55,079 --> 00:15:59,041
<i>♪ Even if you let go, I'll come back ♪</i>

238
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:01,168
<i>- ♪ Do you know when I found you ♪</i>
- Hey.

239
00:16:01,251 --> 00:16:03,379
<i>♪ Everything changed? ♪</i>

240
00:16:03,462 --> 00:16:06,465
You keep rewatching that.
You miss him, don't you?

241
00:16:06,548 --> 00:16:08,676
<i>♪ I'm coming home ♪</i>

242
00:16:08,759 --> 00:16:11,845
[CROWD CHEERING IN VIDEO]

243
00:16:11,929 --> 00:16:13,305
But honestly?

244
00:16:14,306 --> 00:16:17,434
I doubt he will forgive you.

245
00:16:17,518 --> 00:16:21,563
[CROWD CHEERING IN VIDEO]

246
00:16:21,647 --> 00:16:23,273
I'll still try.

247
00:16:23,357 --> 00:16:24,692
He's the only family I have left.

248
00:16:24,775 --> 00:16:27,903
- [PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]
- [JORDAN KEEPS SINGING]

249
00:16:27,987 --> 00:16:29,655
That video went viral, right?

250
00:16:32,074 --> 00:16:33,283
Okay. How about this?

251
00:16:33,867 --> 00:16:35,619
Let's say

252
00:16:36,745 --> 00:16:40,040
that he wasn't famous
and hadn't achieved anything in life.

253
00:16:40,124 --> 00:16:41,750
That he didn't own a business.

254
00:16:42,793 --> 00:16:44,253
Would you still approach him?

255
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:47,756
[SIGHS DEEPLY]

256
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,757
Yes.

257
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:53,971
I have to make amends
for all of my shortcomings.

258
00:16:54,054 --> 00:16:58,142
- [PERFORMANCE IN VIDEO CONTINUES]
- [CROWD CHEERING]

259
00:16:58,225 --> 00:16:59,768
[MOUTHS] Wow.

260
00:17:02,146 --> 00:17:06,984
<i>♪ Do you know when I found you</i>
<i>Everything changed? ♪</i>

261
00:17:12,448 --> 00:17:19,288
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

262
00:17:25,753 --> 00:17:28,505
<i>When my mother lost her sanity,</i>
<i>when my sister died--</i>

263
00:17:28,589 --> 00:17:31,050
<i>I don't know why</i>
<i>I expected you to come back.</i>

264
00:17:31,925 --> 00:17:33,260
<i>I hoped you would.</i>

265
00:17:34,636 --> 00:17:36,972
<i>My sister died.</i>
<i>Your daughter died!</i>

266
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:40,642
<i>She was your daughter!</i>
<i>Your eldest daughter!</i>

267
00:17:41,268 --> 00:17:42,603
<i>But you never returned.</i>

268
00:17:43,228 --> 00:17:44,730
<i>What, that's it?</i>

269
00:17:45,272 --> 00:17:47,649
<i>I just want to spend my remaining days…</i>

270
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,654
<i>with you.</i>

271
00:17:53,947 --> 00:17:58,202
<i>I want us to patch things up</i>
<i>and be a family.</i>

272
00:17:58,786 --> 00:18:00,954
<i>That is all I want.</i>

273
00:18:01,747 --> 00:18:03,207
<i>I'm sorry, my dear.</i>

274
00:18:07,336 --> 00:18:08,712
Dear?

275
00:18:11,006 --> 00:18:12,674
[DOOR CREAKS OPEN]

276
00:18:12,758 --> 00:18:13,675
Dad.

277
00:18:13,759 --> 00:18:15,969
I'm sorry I put you through all that.

278
00:18:16,053 --> 00:18:20,808
I should be blamed for
what happened to your sister, not you.

279
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,853
Thank you for understanding.

280
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:28,232
I should be the one thanking you.

281
00:18:29,650 --> 00:18:31,443
Get some rest, Dad.

282
00:18:32,027 --> 00:18:33,862
- Good night.
- Good night.

283
00:18:35,489 --> 00:18:41,870
[MUSIC BECOMES POIGNANT]

284
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:48,794
<i>- Take care, Oliver.</i>
- [OLIVER] <i>Bye.</i>

285
00:18:50,212 --> 00:18:51,088
<i>Bye-bye!</i>

286
00:18:51,171 --> 00:18:54,258
[BREATHING DEEPLY]

287
00:18:54,341 --> 00:18:55,801
<i>Are you all right?</i>

288
00:18:56,635 --> 00:18:58,512
<i>I'm okay. I'm fine, dear.</i>

289
00:19:01,515 --> 00:19:02,558
<i>Dad?</i>

290
00:19:05,936 --> 00:19:07,437
<i>Your ID isn't ready yet.</i>

291
00:19:07,521 --> 00:19:09,815
<i>What's taking so long? I can pay you.</i>

292
00:19:09,898 --> 00:19:11,150
<i>I'll get money from my son.</i>

293
00:19:11,233 --> 00:19:13,527
<i>That's if he can still lend you some.</i>

294
00:19:14,153 --> 00:19:15,154
<i>What do you mean?</i>

295
00:19:16,446 --> 00:19:17,781
<i>Where's Caloy?</i>

296
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:20,242
<i>We will be filing</i>
<i>an Affidavit of Desistance</i>

297
00:19:20,325 --> 00:19:22,578
<i>with the Office of the Prosecutor</i>
<i>handling your case.</i>

298
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:24,872
<i>However, this is not</i>
<i>an automatic dismissal.</i>

299
00:19:24,955 --> 00:19:27,791
<i>It is still subject to</i>
<i>the evaluation of the prosecutor</i>

300
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:29,501
<i>and will require clearance from the court.</i>

301
00:19:29,585 --> 00:19:30,836
<i>Billy.</i>

302
00:19:30,919 --> 00:19:32,629
<i>Billy, thank you so much.</i>

303
00:19:32,713 --> 00:19:34,590
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

304
00:19:34,673 --> 00:19:37,593
<i>What about my mother?</i>

305
00:19:37,676 --> 00:19:41,680
<i>Will you withdraw the charges</i>
<i>against her too?</i>

306
00:19:43,223 --> 00:19:44,474
<i>Billy.</i>

307
00:19:46,185 --> 00:19:47,477
<i>Billy, I'm begging you.</i>

308
00:19:47,561 --> 00:19:50,731
<i>If you drop the case</i>
<i>against my mom,</i>

309
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:53,442
<i>I promise I'll watch over her.</i>

310
00:19:53,525 --> 00:19:55,903
<i>I promise she won't bother you.</i>

311
00:19:55,986 --> 00:20:00,490
<i>I promise, Billy. Please.</i>
<i>Just withdraw the case against my mother.</i>

312
00:20:00,574 --> 00:20:01,742
<i>Please, Billy. Please.</i>

313
00:20:01,825 --> 00:20:03,577
<i>Have mercy on my mother. Please.</i>

314
00:20:05,579 --> 00:20:10,334
<i>Didn't I tell you to remind me</i>
<i>to make the deposit?</i>

315
00:20:10,417 --> 00:20:12,336
<i>Yes, chief. I texted you the other day--</i>

316
00:20:12,419 --> 00:20:15,172
<i>You only texted me, Blaire!</i>
<i>You should've called me!</i>

317
00:20:15,255 --> 00:20:16,965
<i>I'm sorry, chief.</i>

318
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:19,009
<i>Chief, everyone's already</i>
<i>in the boardroom.</i>

319
00:20:19,092 --> 00:20:22,054
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

320
00:20:24,473 --> 00:20:27,392
<i>They're bringing me</i>
<i>to a mental hospital!</i>

321
00:20:27,476 --> 00:20:29,186
<i>I'm not crazy!</i>

322
00:20:29,269 --> 00:20:31,104
<i>Of course not!</i>

323
00:20:31,188 --> 00:20:32,731
<i>I know you're not.</i>

324
00:20:32,814 --> 00:20:37,736
<i>But… please don't complain.</i>

325
00:20:37,819 --> 00:20:38,904
<i>Because…</i>

326
00:20:39,446 --> 00:20:42,282
<i>Ma, they fell for our act.</i>

327
00:20:49,414 --> 00:20:51,208
<i>Your daughter couldn't</i>
<i>say no to you.</i>

328
00:20:51,291 --> 00:20:53,293
<i>That's how much she loves you.</i>

329
00:20:53,377 --> 00:20:55,337
<i>When is Bea getting out?</i>

330
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:57,714
<i>That depends on whether</i>
<i>the court approves of it.</i>

331
00:20:57,798 --> 00:21:00,759
<i>Until an official</i>
<i>court dismissal order is issued,</i>

332
00:21:02,469 --> 00:21:04,429
<i>she isn't allowed out.</i>

333
00:21:04,513 --> 00:21:05,847
<i>Just relax.</i>

334
00:21:05,931 --> 00:21:06,848
<i>Okay?</i>

335
00:21:06,932 --> 00:21:08,976
<i>Jordan, of course I'm stressed.</i>

336
00:21:09,059 --> 00:21:11,395
<i>People's livelihoods are</i>
<i>at stake here.</i>

337
00:21:11,478 --> 00:21:15,691
<i>And you want me to do what?</i>
<i>Go to your bar to chill?</i>

338
00:21:16,358 --> 00:21:21,405
<i>What I need to be okay are results.</i>
<i>Ideas to help the company.</i>

339
00:21:21,488 --> 00:21:25,200
<i>But everywhere I go,</i>
<i>all I hear about are problems!</i>

340
00:21:25,284 --> 00:21:26,868
<i>So do you have any suggestions?</i>

341
00:21:26,952 --> 00:21:28,704
<i>Or are you too busy</i>
<i>with your side hustles?</i>

342
00:21:28,787 --> 00:21:34,418
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]
